<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="arch" name="Architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="720" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;Website Health Checker&lt;/b&gt; - architecture" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Rules decide the verdict. Claude only explains and groups findings." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="45" width="700" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Inputs (any of these)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="85" width="200" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="CLI
&lt;i&gt;check --url any-site&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="120" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="sites.yaml
&lt;i&gt;many sites + settings&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="185" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="HTTP API
&lt;i&gt;POST /check (token + allow-list)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="250" width="170" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="GitHub Action / cron
&lt;i&gt;every 30 min + after deploy&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="320" width="170" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="Pipeline" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="85" width="1060" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Profiler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;~5 requests&lt;br&gt;- clean up URL, www / apex&lt;br&gt;- TLS ok?  WAF / captcha?&lt;br&gt;- login wall?  soft 404?&lt;br&gt;- robots.txt, Crawl-delay&lt;br&gt;- latency -&gt; timeouts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="120" width="175" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Crawler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- sitemaps (gzip, nested, sampled)&lt;br&gt;- pages spread across sections&lt;br&gt;- trap protection (?page=, calendars)&lt;br&gt;- API discovery from JS&lt;br&gt;- link checks by priority" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="120" width="195" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="3. Checkers (parallel, no LLM)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="110" width="250" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="availability" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="722" y="140" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="links &amp; assets" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="140" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="TLS / DNS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="722" y="188" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="security headers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="188" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="content" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="722" y="236" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="SEO" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="236" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="performance" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="722" y="284" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="API endpoints" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="284" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="plugins (custom rules)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="722" y="332" width="110" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Triage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;claude -p (haiku)&lt;br&gt;~3k tokens, findings only&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;skip if healthy&lt;br&gt;cache if unchanged&lt;br&gt;rules fallback" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="985" y="120" width="160" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;verdict + score&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(rules only)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;JSON + Markdown&lt;br&gt;diff vs last run" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1165" y="120" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="snapshot" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="findings" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="root causes&lt;br&gt;+ fixes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c31" target="c32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="&lt;b&gt;Verdicts:&lt;/b&gt; HEALTHY · DEGRADED · UNHEALTHY · DOWN · UNVERIFIABLE (blocked) · ERROR (tool crash)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="285" width="270" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="Exit codes: 0 healthy, 1 degraded, 2 unhealthy/down, 3 unverifiable/error" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="340" width="270" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="&lt;b&gt;Fetcher&lt;/b&gt; (shared by profiler + crawler)&lt;br&gt;GET / HEAD only · request + time budget · slows down on 429 / Retry-After · per-host limits · retry once · timer only on network time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="450" width="620" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="&lt;b&gt;Target website&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;any site on the internet or localhost&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="450" width="220" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#b09500;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c43"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="read-only requests" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" target="c44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="6. Hooks / outputs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="85" width="210" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="signed webhook&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Slack, Teams, any URL&lt;br&gt;fires only on change&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="120" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="on_complete_command&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;e.g. open a ticket&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="195" width="180" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="--json / exit codes&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;for CI and scripts&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="255" width="180" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="reports/&amp;lt;site&amp;gt;/latest.md&lt;br&gt;latest.json" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="315" width="180" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c48"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c49"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c50"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="Safety rules (apply everywhere)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="540" width="610" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="- read-only: never submits forms, never sends POST / PUT / DELETE&lt;br&gt;- APIs called only if the site's own JS calls them with GET, never logout / delete / pay&lt;br&gt;- respects robots.txt and Crawl-delay, honest User-Agent, never bypasses captchas&lt;br&gt;- site text is untrusted: cleaned before Claude sees it, answer is validated&lt;br&gt;- secrets only from env vars, API has token + host allow-list (no SSRF)&lt;br&gt;- any crash -&gt; report with verdict ERROR, not a traceback" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="975" y="570" width="590" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="Evals (how I know it works)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="540" width="890" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="&lt;b&gt;Planted faults&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;local site, 21 bugs + clean copy&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;run_eval.py&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;21/21 found, 0 false alarms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="575" width="270" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="&lt;b&gt;Edge cases&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;10 test-site modes (soft 404, WAF, 429,&lt;br&gt;traps, gzip sitemap, login ...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;pytest&lt;/i&gt; - 38/38 pass" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="345" y="575" width="270" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="&lt;b&gt;Real world&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;24 live sites + separate verifier&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;realworld.py&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;24/24 finished, 98% confirmed, 9/9 known" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="575" width="285" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>